observed = "Static source inspection found five stale in_progress tasks with no current owner; three done integration tasks whose required hosted or middleware predecessor remained pending (16.4, 17.5 and 17.6); a done mirror-publisher task with only client traits and in-memory chain implementations (25.1); one implemented occupancy task whose Rust ledger is not connected to protocol charging, state roots, snapshots or receipts (29.5); and one pending labelling task whose implementation is present (26.2). The ledger also omitted production KMS custody, a runnable human-api server, an executable interop gateway and hosted/seven-SDK program operations. The active spec now records those gaps as tasks 5.8, 13.6, 22.4 and 33.7, resets stale ownership, reopens incomplete integrations, and moves qualification/documentation-only leaves after all product-code waves."
assumption = "This is a code-presence and dependency reconciliation only. No compilation, test, benchmark, live service, external network, fault-injection or qualification result is claimed. Human qualification must decide whether every status=done or status=implemented task satisfies its runtime acceptance criteria."
