observed = "The emulator GET /v1/state response is a global unproved debug dump of in-memory cells and accounts. No production proof-gated or principal-filtered state snapshot contract exists, so exposing that shape would violate the same principal isolation and protocol-fact rules required of the human plane. The production route is present but fails closed with principal_state_proof_unavailable, and /readyz names the missing boundary instead of claiming readiness."
