observed = "The implementation supplies a concrete replay-engine binder and real batch-finalizer adapter, reserves one terminal system sequence, publishes the versioned occupancy receipt into the canonical receipt section and exercises the adapter through an empty-batch replay artifact. The repository still has no serving producer coordinator that owns replay-engine construction and can prove this binder is installed exactly once before accepting version-two batches."
assumption = "The production batch-coordinator owner must call lxp_programs_replay_engine_bind during fail-closed startup and use the same replay boundary for production and replica execution. Qualification must refuse a version-two engine without the binder and compare producer and replica roots for empty and nonempty batches."
