assumption = "Human qualification must restart the deployable publisher over clean, corrupt, missing, duplicate, gapped and maximum-sequence spools; prove a second process is excluded; inject a node batch mismatch; and show no status or chain publication thread starts after failed recovery. Source tests were written but no build, restart or passing test result is asserted by this implementation repair."
