observed = "Post-implementation review found that corrupt transient surplus data was treated as a zero balance, critical EndBlock accounting and persistence failures were logged while block processing continued, and the pointer migration sliced unvalidated keys, trusted unchecked ABI output shapes and discarded EVM call errors. The repair returns the surplus decoding error, makes consensus-critical EndBlock failures deterministic, validates key and ABI result shapes before use, and propagates all one-off EVM and migration errors."
