symbol = "DepositProofConfig::paxeer_chain_id, DepositProofVerifier::admit_finality, derive_deposit_id"
observed = "The proof authority previously owned the endpoint quorum, confirmation depth, LayerX network and protocol but did not own the expected Paxeer chain identity, leaving the finality report chain bound only by the later journey plan. DepositProofConfig now requires a nonzero Paxeer u64 chain ID, refuses endpoint declarations for another chain, persists that identity in DepositProofVerifier and rejects otherwise valid quorum evidence with FinalityChainIdMismatch before custody extraction or DepositProof construction. The journey comparison remains a second independent binding. Deposit ID derivation now hashes an exact constant ABI length with a compile-time byte-length assertion instead of silently substituting zero if a constant conversion failed."
assumption = "Human qualification must exercise zero and endpoint-mismatched proof configuration, exact-quorum finality evidence from another chain, a chain ID above u32::MAX, and parity of derive_deposit_id with the deployed Paxeer custody contract. No build, test, formatting, install, network call or passing result is asserted by this source repair."
severity = "authority-boundary"

