observed = "Final trust-boundary review found the first CLI repair selected abi_version by scanning raw manifest text, so malformed JSON and an abi_version token embedded in an unrelated string could be mistaken for real metadata. The repair replaces text scanning with serde_json deserialization through a custom top-level map visitor that requires one integer abi_version, detects duplicate abi_version keys before value collapse, ignores nested or embedded tokens, rejects malformed JSON and non-integer values, and accepts only frozen revisions one and two before CLI mismatch comparison."
